OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786636099
OL,3,CVolunteer 'leapt into action' to save
OL,4,Cfour children cut off by tide
OL,6,FFour children and an adult have been
OL,7,Frescued after becoming "stranded" on
OL,8,Fsandbanks cut off by the tide.
OL,10,FThe Blackpool branch of the Royal
OL,11,FNational Lifeboat Institute (RNLI)
OL,12,Fwere called out to the incident off
OL,13,Fthe coast of Cleveleys in Lancashire
OL,14,Fat around 20:30 on Wednesday 12 August
OL,15,F2026.
OL,17,FBut before the lifeboats could reach
OL,18,Fthe stranded group, nearby RNLI
OL,19,Fvolunteer Rick Williams became aware
OL,20,Fof the incident and swam to the
OL,21,Fchildren.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
