PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786636099
OL,3,CVolunteer 'leapt into action' to save
OL,4,Cfour children cut off by tide
OL,6,FRick was able to rescue the adult and
OL,7,Fall four children from the deep water
OL,8,Fto reunite them with their mothers on
OL,9,Fthe beach.
OL,11,FOnce everyone was safe, the Atlantic
OL,12,F85 lifeboat was stood down and
OL,13,Freturned to the RNLI station.
OL,15,FAn RNLI Spokesperson thanked Rick for
OL,16,Fhis "great response and reaction", and
OL,17,Fsaid the rescue acts as a warning of
OL,18,Fthe dangers that come with swimming
OL,19,Fduring tide times.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
