FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786636099
OL,3,CVolunteer 'leapt into action' to save
OL,4,Cfour children cut off by tide
OL,6,FThey said: "This incident once again
OL,7,Fhighlights the danger of our
OL,8,Fsandbanks, with incoming tides and
OL,9,Fcurrents cutting off the sandbanks.
OL,10,FPlease be aware of your surroundings,
OL,11,Ftide times and alert to the dangers."
OL,13,FRick's wife Nicola also witnessed the
OL,14,Frescue, and said she was "very proud"
OL,15,Fof her husband.
OL,17,FShe said he prevented "what could have
OL,18,Fbeen quite a tragedy along this
OL,19,Fparticularly treacherous sandbank."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/3
